{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1119034-sentinels-of-the-multiverse-character-conversion-thread","id":1119034,"title":"Sentinels of the Multiverse Character Conversion Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-21T10:52:14-07:00","id":1119034,"title":"Sentinels of the Multiverse Character Conversion Thread","content":"Seeing as how I was making conversion ideas for various villains from<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentinels_of_the_Multiverse\" target=\"_blank\"> Sentinels of the Multiverse</a>, it was suggested that I make its own thread.<br /> <br /> So, here it is.<br /> <br /> I'll start with a personal favorite of mine, with no real balancing or Merits:<br /> <br /> <b>Deadline</b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Virtue:</b> Kind/Brave<br /> <br /> <b>Vice</b>: Stubborn<br /> <br /> <b>Integrity: </b>2 (While Deadline is an alien, he has a psyche that resemble's humanity's, and his mind reacts to stress in largely the same ways. Of course, given how he is attempting to destroy most modern civilization for its own good, he is not in a good place-he has a perpetual Broken Condition over the course of his tenure as supervillain).<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Attributes</b>: Intelligence 5, Wits 4, Resolve 10<br /> <br /> <b>Social Attributes</b>: Presence 5, Manipulation 3, Composure 6<br /> <br /> <b>Physical Attributes</b>: Strength 6, Dexterity 5, Stamina 6<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Skills</b>: Academics 3, Crafts 2, Investigation 3, Medicine 4, Occult 5, Science (Environment) 5 <br /> <br /> <b>Social Skills</b>: Empathy 3, Expression (Singing) 4, Intimidation (Stoic Alien Invader) 5,<br /> <br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Athletics 4, Brawl 2, Firearms (Atraxia Sphere) 4, Drive (Spacecraft) 3, Survival (Disaster Environment) 5, Weaponry (Glaives) 4<br /> <br /> <b>Potency: </b>7<br /> <br /> <b>Dread Powers:</b> Home Ground (Disaster Areas), Immortal, Influence (Catastrophe) *****, Maze, Madness and Terror, Reality Stutter<br /> <br /> <b>Ban</b>: Deadline's Influence is a manifestation of alien technology and sorcery, not his personal ability. He cannot use the Create or Mass Create abilities of his Influence unless he has access to his tech and must ramp up an Extreme Environment Condition to 5 before he can actively start destroying parts of the Earth.<br /> <br /> <b>Bane: </b>Endline technology/magic.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-22T10:41:38-07:00","id":1119284,"title":"","content":"Also, without Merits, this is a framework for a longer writeup when no longer occupied<br /> <br /> Spite:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Virtue:</b> Masochistic<br /> <br /> <b>Vice</b>: Cruel/Treacherous<br /> <br /> <b>Integrity: </b>0 (as a human serial killer, Spite no longer thinks in human terms)<br /> <br /> <b>Undertaking: </b>Psycho Slasher<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/155637-slasher-gmc-port\">Nightmare:</a> 4 (becomes 5 after he flips)<br /> <br /> <b>Dread Powers: </b>Regenerate *** initially, but gains one per drug he injects. Loses Regenerate once he uses all five of his drug cocktails (Demon's Kiss gives him Fire Elemental, Mind-Phyre gives him Influence (Traumatic Memories), Upsilon gives him Natural Weapons **, Omicron gives him Drain, and XI gives him Toxic *).<br /> <br /> <b>Ban: </b>Like most Psychos, Spite simply cannot let go of a grudge-and that interferes with his powers. He cannot use his Dread Powers when Obsessed, except as a scheme to force a confrontation with the entities he is Obsessed with.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 07-22-2017, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-22T11:34:25-07:00","id":1119301,"title":"","content":"Good stuff, and you have good taste in games. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-22T17:54